---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="AI Use"
  description="Where I stand on generative AI, and how I use it across this site and my projects."
>
  <header class="stack-s page-head">
    <h1>AI Use</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      The disclosure the "GenAI" badges on my projects link to.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>Replace this with an honest statement covering:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>What "None / Some / Used" mean for a project's GenAI badge.</li>
      <li>Where AI shows up in your own workflow (code, art, writing) and where it doesn't.</li>
      <li>Why the write-ups are AI-free specifically, if that's worth calling out here too.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-block: var(--space-l);
  }
</style>
